# Reference-layer intermediates, written by refscan135.py and documented in README.md as *not*
# part of the committed set: `refs/raw.json` is the pre-curation arXiv/Crossref dump (769 records,
# ~1.2 MB) and is reproducible only with network access; every entry the pool keeps is already in
# `refs/pool.json`.  `*.stage` is the atomic-write sibling an interrupted run may leave behind.
refs/raw.json
refs/*.stage
__pycache__/
